meta {
  name: Numbers numbersDirectoryListingGet
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v2.2/numbers/:number/directory-listing
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  number: <number>
}

docs {
**Get the directory listing**
Returns the number's directory assistance (411) listing as it is currently published, and any change still being applied. status is listed, not_listed, pending (an add or change is being applied), removing, or unavailable (the number cannot be listed). eligible tells whether a listing can be added.

OperationId: `numbersDirectoryListingGet`
}
